---
module: pong
func_id: paddle-bounce-angle
---

***conformance tests***

# center-hit-bounces-flat
When the ball hits the center of a :Paddle: that does not move, the ball leaves the :Paddle: horizontally.

# hit-above-the-center-bounces-upward
When the ball hits a :Paddle: that does not move above its center, the ball leaves the :Paddle: upward.

# hit-below-the-center-bounces-downward
When the ball hits a :Paddle: that does not move below its center, the ball leaves the :Paddle: downward.

***acceptance tests***
